EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}What?! You're visiting again?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}You must really love my décor,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Cosa?! Sei tornat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} di nuovo?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Deve piacerti da matti come ho
arredato casa, eh, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ne?! Yine mi ziyarete geldin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dekoruma gerçekten BAYILIYORSUN,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, how awesome is this?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}You're back for the billionth
time today...YAY!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Anda, qué fuerte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Has venido como unas cien veces
ya... ¡Chachi!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Stupefacente! Strabiliante! Mitico!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sarà almeno la miliardesima volta
che ci vediamo oggi... Evvaiii!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, bu ne kadar süper farkında mısın?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Bugün milyarıncı kez geri geldin...
YAŞASIN!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Good morning...again{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}I must be doing something right,
because you keep visiting!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Buenos días... de nuevo{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Te trato tan bien que no puedes
aguantar sin mí, je, je.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ciaaao per l'ennesima volta...{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ti deve piacere davvero casa mia
se non fai altro che tornare da me!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Günaydın... yine{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Demek bir şeyleri doğru yapıyorum,
çünkü ziyarete gelmeye devam ediyorsun!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bugün kaçıncı gelişin BU,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Sanki burada yaşıyorsun falan...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
ve buna bayılıyorum!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Back again? Like, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}again-again?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Looks like you really love
these late-night talks, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yine mi geldin? Yani, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}yine-yine mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Şu gece sohbetlerine gerçekten
bayılıyorsun, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
